{"excerpt_id":"ex_4727592a5328_017","source_id":"src_4727592a5328","source_hash":"eeb3c05eb6da64729d8c584212af2632b6fec9a86acfbf397fb3c7486affd998","text":"{\n\"TransactionType\" : \"Clawback\" ,\n\"Account\" : \"rp6abvbTbjoce8ZDJkT6snvxTZSYMBCC9S\" ,\n\"Amount\" : {\n\"currency\" : \"FOO\" ,\n\"issuer\" : \"rsA2LpzuawewSBQXkiju3YQTMzW13pAAdW\" ,\n\"value\" : \"314.159\"\n}\n}","location_hint":"paragraph 230","char_start":4945,"char_end":5138,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:48.763Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_4727592a5328_018","source_id":"src_4727592a5328","source_hash":"eeb3c05eb6da64729d8c584212af2632b6fec9a86acfbf397fb3c7486affd998","text":"In addition to the common fields , Clawback transactions use the following fields:","location_hint":"paragraph 232","char_start":5157,"char_end":5239,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:48.763Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_4727592a5328_019","source_id":"src_4727592a5328","source_hash":"eeb3c05eb6da64729d8c584212af2632b6fec9a86acfbf397fb3c7486affd998","text":"Field JSON Type Internal Type Required? Description","location_hint":"paragraph 233","char_start":5243,"char_end":5294,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:48.763Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_4727592a5328_020","source_id":"src_4727592a5328","source_hash":"eeb3c05eb6da64729d8c584212af2632b6fec9a86acfbf397fb3c7486affd998","text":"Amount Currency Amount Amount Yes The amount to claw back. The quantity in the value sub-field must not be zero. If this is more than the current balance, the transaction claws back the entire balance. When clawing back trust line tokens, the issuer sub-field indicates the token holder to claw back tokens from.","location_hint":"paragraph 234","char_start":5298,"char_end":5610,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:48.763Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_4727592a5328_021","source_id":"src_4727592a5328","source_hash":"eeb3c05eb6da64729d8c584212af2632b6fec9a86acfbf397fb3c7486affd998","text":"Holder String AccountID No The holder to claw back tokens from, if clawing back MPTs. The holder must have a non-zero balance of the MPT issuance indicated in the Amount field.","location_hint":"paragraph 235","char_start":5612,"char_end":5788,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:48.763Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_4727592a5328_022","source_id":"src_4727592a5328","source_hash":"eeb3c05eb6da64729d8c584212af2632b6fec9a86acfbf397fb3c7486affd998","text":"Requires the MPTokensV1 amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 236","char_start":5790,"char_end":5836,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:48.763Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_4727592a5328_023","source_id":"src_4727592a5328","source_hash":"eeb3c05eb6da64729d8c584212af2632b6fec9a86acfbf397fb3c7486affd998","text":"When clawing back trust line tokens, you must omit the Holder field. When clawing back MPTs, you must provide the Holder field.","location_hint":"paragraph 237","char_start":5842,"char_end":5969,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:48.763Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_4727592a5328_024","source_id":"src_4727592a5328","source_hash":"eeb3c05eb6da64729d8c584212af2632b6fec9a86acfbf397fb3c7486affd998","text":"Besides errors that can occur for all transactions, Clawback transactions can result in the following transaction result codes :","location_hint":"paragraph 239","char_start":5984,"char_end":6112,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:48.763Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_4727592a5328_025","source_id":"src_4727592a5328","source_hash":"eeb3c05eb6da64729d8c584212af2632b6fec9a86acfbf397fb3c7486affd998","text":"temDISABLED The Clawback amendment is not enabled.","location_hint":"paragraph 241","char_start":6142,"char_end":6192,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:48.763Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_4727592a5328_026","source_id":"src_4727592a5328","source_hash":"eeb3c05eb6da64729d8c584212af2632b6fec9a86acfbf397fb3c7486affd998","text":"temBAD_AMOUNT The amount of tokens specified to claw back is invalid or zero, or the specified holder is the issuer.","location_hint":"paragraph 242","char_start":6194,"char_end":6310,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:48.763Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_4727592a5328_027","source_id":"src_4727592a5328","source_hash":"eeb3c05eb6da64729d8c584212af2632b6fec9a86acfbf397fb3c7486affd998","text":"tecAMM_ACCOUNT The specified holder is an Automated Market Maker (AMM). To claw back tokens from an AMM, use AMMClawback instead.","location_hint":"paragraph 243","char_start":6312,"char_end":6441,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:48.763Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_4727592a5328_028","source_id":"src_4727592a5328","source_hash":"eeb3c05eb6da64729d8c584212af2632b6fec9a86acfbf397fb3c7486affd998","text":"tecNO_LINE There is no trust line with the counterparty or that trust line&#x27;s balance is 0.","location_hint":"paragraph 244","char_start":6443,"char_end":6538,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:48.763Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_4727592a5328_029","source_id":"src_4727592a5328","source_hash":"eeb3c05eb6da64729d8c584212af2632b6fec9a86acfbf397fb3c7486affd998","text":"tecNO_PERMISSION The sender of this transaction does not have the ability to claw back the specified tokens.","location_hint":"paragraph 245","char_start":6540,"char_end":6648,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:48.763Z"}
